Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yammu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,One of you two fools is about to feel the\Nfury of my ultimate creature, Desgardius.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I attack you, Yugi, my beast will\Nwipe out the rest of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I choose you, Kaiba, your blue\Neyes will be a meal for my Desgardius.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget what happens\Nwhen your life points reach zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.43,0:01:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shadow box will destroy\Nthe surface below you and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,send you plunging into the\Nshadow realm for eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And your friends will join our army of\Nrare hunters and serve Master Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the time has come for\Nme to decide which one of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.05,0:01:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,you pathetic nitwits to\Nattack with Death Guardians!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.29,0:01:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose you, Yugi Moto!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, we're supposed to be a team, Loomis!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we both get\Na say in this decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,While I agree we have to destroy Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving Kaiba's blue-eyes white dragon on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the field would be an\Nextremely foolish mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.67,0:02:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's my move and I choose Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.07,0:02:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering whether you'd have the guts\Nto challenge my blue-eyes white dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I know. Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're all talk and no action.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a coward would take\Nthe easy way out instead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,of flexing his muscles\Nand attacking my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba must be trying to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows without my help,\Nhe'll lose this duel for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Kaiba's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacking Yugi first could be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.45,0:02:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,His monsters are weak and I\Ncould destroy them at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why waste my creature's first attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, there's been a change in plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.37,0:02:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Discardius, destroy Kaiba's blue eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you were wrong, Kaiba. No one\Ncalls me a coward and gets away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:03:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,with it yuki better not make me\Nregret saving him destroy them yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.31,0:03:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,yes remember thanks to mask of the\Naccursed and mask of dispel you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,lose another thousand life points\Nfine this duel is almost over anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret not attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When I play the card in my\Nhand and destroy you, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be Attacking Blue Eyes was\Na big mistake Cause now Yugi has
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Something even worse in store for\Nyou. It's a lie. You can't summon high
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,power monsters because of our trap\Ncard Your trap card only prevents us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,from sacrificing. But that's not the only\Nway to summon powerful monsters, Umbra
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So I play this, Gamma, the Magnet Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.97,0:03:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I have three Magnet\NWarriors on the field at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can activate their special\Nability, Monster Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Transform? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,all three creatures will\Nnow transform into one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,mighty warrior with triple\Nthe attack strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Valkyra, the Magna Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this attack payback for\Ndestroying my blue eyes, Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's Valkyra has 200 more attack\Npoints than your Desgardias.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,so with one swing of its sword, it can\Ncompletely annihilate your masked beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough break, Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time to take our revenge from my Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Eyes White Dragon So\Nwhat are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been patient long enough.\NStop stalling and attack them now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,prove you're not scared and\Navenge the destruction of my Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Eyes White Dragon. It's true\Nthat in a head-to-head battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,my Magna Warrior could easily defeat their
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Desgardias And they don't seem to have any
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,hidden trap cards on the field But Loomis\Nand Umbra don't seem nervous at all Do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.03,0:05:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy their monster now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Could their masked monster, Desgardius,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,have a hidden ability that\Nmight block my attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as that fool attacks my\Nmonster, he'll be in for a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And a one-way trip to\Nthe dreaded Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave up my blue eyes for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And let you summon your monster,\Nand this is the thanks I get!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now destroy their\Nmonster so I can move one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,step closer to finding my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And do it right now or you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, if you ever want to see Mokuba\Nagain, we have to duel intelligently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:06:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Anger will only cloud\Nyour reason. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You must try to put your frustration\Naside and trust in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you do, you'll be playing right\Ninto the hands of the Rare Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to crush them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're losing focus, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to win, you\Nmust believe in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.03,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, part of the cards. Who needs it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to win this duel\Nis to play my Egyptian God card,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to summon it, I\Nneed to sacrifice three monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as their Mask\Nof Restrict is in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,we're not allowed to sacrifice anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A way to summon my Egyptian god card\Neven with their mask on the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But it can only work if Yugi's\Nwilling to give up his monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave up my Blue-Eyes\NWhite Dragon to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's only fair he makes a sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like depending\Non anyone but myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:07:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll do what I have\Nto do to save my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we can win! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyra, the Magna Warrior,\Nattack their monster, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He took my bait, and now he'll regret it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone. You may have\Ndestroyed my beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi But you've also activated its\Nspecial ability What special ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When Desgardias is sent to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,it leaves behind three masks, which\Ncombine to form a new, more powerful mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mask of Remnants!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,As revenge for your attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.31,0:07:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,this mask allows me to control one of\Nyour monsters as if it were my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you only have one monster,\Nit's a good thing it's one size fits all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyra the Magna Warrior\Nbelongs to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.73,0:08:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're through, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your defenses are gone and\Nthe Shadow Realm awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Yugi on this turn, Umbra, and\NI'll take out Kaiba myself! With pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.59,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure Kaiba never sees\Nhis runt of a brother again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When I send him to join\NYugi in the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Masquerade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,With this magic card in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm able to control one of Loomis'\Nmonsters as if it were my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, my Magna Warrior, attack and\Ndestroy your former Master Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't celebrate just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal my face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:08:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Diffusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It will break down your monster into its\Nthree separate parts and destroy your mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our attack just failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.93,0:09:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you shocked?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're no match for\Nour combined skills, Rare Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my Egyptian god guard. Not quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as my mask are restricted\Nin effect, you can't summon it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have to sacrifice three\Nmonsters and my mask prevents that! Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mask only stops me from\Nsacrificing my own monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but I plan to sacrifice your monsters\Ninstead, Loomis, with this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the magic\Ncard, Soul Exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,which lets me sacrifice\Nyour three Magnet Warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaiba summons Obelisk the Tormentor,\Nwe'll have no hope of winning this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We must stop him, or\NMarek will be furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you two clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for my little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been talking about winning my\NEgyptian God card this entire duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for you\Nto experience its power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor, arise\Nand wreak your ultimate revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's payback time for kidnapping Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare to feel a force like no other!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.91,0:10:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk, attack Umbra's\Nlife points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Umpra, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Umpra, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fine for now, but thanks\Nto my Egyptian God card,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.83,0:11:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,his life points don't look so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you've fallen victim\Nto your own trap, rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When my life point counter reaches\Nzero, I'll plunge into the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Umbra!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Umbra, come back, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're dueling\Nalone now, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The odds are certainly\Nagainst you, Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're powerless against\Nour Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to avoid any further\Ndanger, then you'd better surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him off the hook yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster is just getting warmed up, and\NLoomis needs to pay for what he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He disrespected my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge isn't going to\Nhelp you find Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps if we allow him to surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll tell us where they're\Nhiding the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Yugi, wise up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We must destroy him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't be angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, please don't! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that you have\Ndefeated my rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.51,0:12:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They did their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done with\Nmy friends, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.79,0:13:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This rare hunter's gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this rare hunter is under the\Ncontrol of a man named Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That is ridiculous, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's power is very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And he is the one holding Mokuba captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, tell me where this\Nso-called Marek is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.47,0:13:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you like to know, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll give you a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm closer than you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoyed the\Nspecial duel I set up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.07,0:13:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You fared better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't think just because\Nyou beat my rare hunters that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be rescuing your friends\Nand family anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been preparing for\Nthe next phase of my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.75,0:13:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've been studying each of your decks\Nthrough the eyes of my rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As for your Egyptian God card, Kyla,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk pales in comparison\Nto my Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's no way it can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I defeat you,\NObelisk will be in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.37,0:14:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And I haven't forgotten you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Egyptian God card and Millennium\NPuzzle will be mine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And since my rare hunters failed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come up with the perfect plan\Nto defeat you once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,By playing upon your greatest weakness,\Nyour loyalty to your pathetic friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, they're safe\Nand sound right here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think they're\Non your side anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems their allegiance\Nnow lies with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny how our friends\Nare so quick to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one you want, Merrick, so\Nleave my friends alone. Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid those fools belong\Nto me now, Yugi! Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.39,0:14:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you face me already instead\Nof hiding behind your mind slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But controlling people's\Nminds is so much more fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my Millennium Rod, Yugi's\Nclosest friends are already my mind slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I turn them against him, Yugi\Nwill surrender everything he has to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave my friends alone, Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell me where they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know who you are, but\Nyou better tell me where Mokuba is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.19,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I won this battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so release my little brother just\Nlike you said you would right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.63,0:15:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.03,0:15:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your energy, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He obviously has no intention of\Nhelping us find Mokuba and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then we're going to have\Nto track them down on our own, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe your satellite system can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.61,0:15:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Yugi, first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this rare hunter\Nowes us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This was an official Battle City duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the losers have to give up\None locator card each to the winners.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:16:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one for each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we both have six.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're each guaranteed a spot\Nin the Battle City Finals now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, how can you begin to think about\Nthe tournament after what Marik just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find my friends\Nand your brother right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then help me think of a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Every second counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that one of your helicopters, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mokuba! He escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, but I had to leave Taya behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Taya okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about Joey and Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not so sure\Nabout Joey or Tristan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but up until she helped me\Nescape from the rare hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya was doing all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in the chopper now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like your friend\NTaya saved Mokuba's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:17:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,life And as much as I\Nhate getting involved,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate owing someone a\Nfavor even more. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.05,0:17:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Jefferson Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Take all of your belongings\Nand watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need something to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll help me if you\Ntell me what you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me one of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, less yakking and more packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a train to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Step in and stand clear\Nof the closing doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.37,0:17:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Next stop, Town of Domino.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, where's Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he didn't miss the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you like food, because\NI just brought back plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a cheeseburger and french fries?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, burrito supreme,\Nmacaroni and cheese, sushi, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.47,0:17:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm still nervous about what'll\Nhappen when I take my bandages off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that the doctor said\NI can take them off tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm worried the operation didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, you're going to\Nbe just fine, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You got to have a little\Nfaith, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.49,0:18:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but I want to\Nsee so badly, Tristan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's a part of me that's\Ntoo frightened to face this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you'd think I'm just acting\Nlike a scared little baby, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we all get scared\Nsometimes, but if you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the things that seem to freak us out\Nthe most are usually no big deal at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and I think I'll feel better\Nonce we get to Battle City and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,find Joey Because I need him\Nto give me the courage and the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.81,0:18:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,strength to face the unknown\None more time Like he did when
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I first went to the hospital\NAnd I'll tell you something,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Joey needs you right now\Njust as much as you need him Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll give him the courage he\Nneeds to win the finals. Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so perfect. We'll\Ninspire each other and together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll both overcome our doubts\NThanks for listening to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.37,0:18:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan and I can't wait\Ntill we get to Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:18:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No sweat. Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is our satellite tracking system working?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up a weak signal\Nfrom Joey's tool disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from the same spot where those\Nrare hunters were keeping me and Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be there in about 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.01,0:19:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey and Taya better be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo, he's a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your love
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo, yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,he's a baby Yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,yo, yo
